. It is preferred to use cout stream (also you may use %I64d ).\n\n## Examples\n\nExample 1:\n```\n3 2\n1 2 1\n1 2\n1 3\n```\n```\n3\n6\n```\n\n## Note\n\nConsider the following array (see the second sample) and its [2, 7] subarray (elements of the subarray are colored): \n Then K 1 ΓÇë=ΓÇë3 , K 2 ΓÇë=ΓÇë2 , K 3 ΓÇë=ΓÇë1 , so the power is equal to 3 2 ┬╖1ΓÇë+ΓÇë2 2 ┬╖2ΓÇë+ΓÇë1 2 ┬╖3ΓÇë=ΓÇë20 .","type":"text"}],"contestId":86,"index":"D","memoryLimit":"256 megabytes","name":"Powerful array","problemKey":"86-D","rating":null,"tags":[],"timeLimit":"5 seconds","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/86/problem/D"},{"approaches":[{"label":"Approach 1","number":1,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 2","number":2,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 3","number":3,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 4","number":4,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 5","number":5,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 6","number":6,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 7","number":7,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 8","number":8,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 9","number":9,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 10","number":10,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 11","number":11,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 12","number":12,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 13","number":13,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 14","number":14,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"mai